               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_N202D1">34.5 x 29.5</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_N202D4">Written in brown ink. Paper: 20 staves. Paginated pp. 1-3 in pencil in foreign hand. Last page unnumbered. The upper right-hand corner of p. 3 is very worn, but it is still possible to see Hartmann's original pagination "2" in the complete manuscript. At the end of the music dated: "6/8 53". On the remaining staves of p. 4 the beginning of No. 5 "Ausgang".</physMedium>
